===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la|en}} {{m|la|tetrarchia}} from Ancient Greek {{m|grc|τετραρχία}}, from {{term|tetra||four}} + {{term|archos||ruler}} + ''[[-ia]]'', literally "four rulers".

===Noun===
